Build the main React UI layout for the Chandra OCR demo.

Assume backend runs inside Python virtual environment.

Requirements:

Split screen layout:

* Left panel width 35%
* Right panel width 65%

LEFT PANEL:

* drag/drop upload area
* image preview section
* Start Processing button
* Download Excel button (disabled initially)

RIGHT PANEL:

* live progress stepper card
* vertical timeline layout
* stages:

  1. Upload File
  2. Convert OCR
  3. Poll Convert Status
  4. Extract Structured Data
  5. Build Preview
  6. Generate Excel
  7. Download Ready

Each step supports:

* idle
* running
* completed
* failed

Visual requirements:

* modern enterprise UI
* rounded cards
* subtle shadows
* Tailwind only
* responsive

Create reusable components:

* UploadPanel
* ProgressPanel
* StepItem
* PreviewCard

Use mock static data for now.
Do not connect backend yet.
